      "writtenOn": "2026-11-06T13:46:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "METHOD → TARGET → VERSION → CRLF now resumes across RX callbacks, retaining offsets in req. No fields were added to http_ctx_t.\n  • Invalid methods and oversized targets fail before CRLF arrives.\n  • Delimiter scans use bounded 256-byte peeks; validation copies only control data, excluding the body.\n  • Preserved fragmented HTTP/2 handoff and fixed a timeout deadlock exposed by retaining partial prefixes.",
