      "writtenOn": "2026-11-05T22:54:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "listener was validated in http_conn_prepare_request(), but it can disappear while the first request is incomplete. prepared app session is already SESSION_STATE_ACCEPTING, whereas app_worker_stop_listen_session() only cancels CREATED sessions. completing the headers can therefore queue SESSION_CTRL_EVT_ACCEPTED with a stale listener_handle.\nplease revalidate the listener before notifying acceptance. if it disappeared, keep HTTP_CONN_F_NO_APP_SESSION set, disconnect transport, and let existing cleanup path release pending session and fifos without app notifications.",
      "revId": "dc9567690d7d0eb40f3d13b885cd8699cd9f6e53",
